# =====================================================================
#  .gitignore for EN4603 (Digital IC Design) / EN4431 (Analog IC Design)
#  Keeps sources, scripts, netlists, reports and PDFs.
#  Excludes licensed foundry libraries, tool databases and scratch files.
# =====================================================================

# ---- Licensed technology libraries (Cadence gsclib045 / GPDK045) ----
# Educational use only; must not be redistributed. Keep them locally under
# <project>/input/libs/gsclib045/ (see EN4603_Digital_IC_Design/README.md).
**/input/libs/

# ---- Cadence Innovus saved design databases (restoreDesign *.dat) ----
*.dat/

# ---- Archives / backups ----
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# ---- Cadence Virtuoso lock & backup files ----
*.cdslck
*.cdslck.*
*.oa-
*.oa~
*.cdsbak
.cadence/
libManager.log
pvsUI_ipvs.log
CDS.log*

# ---- Pegasus/PVS DRC & LVS result databases (binary) ----
*.pvstdb/
**/REPORTDB/
**/.masco/
**/Edb.readlock
**/.runFormDirLock*
*.ecdb
.*.ecdb
.*.rep.lnn
.*.rep.rdb
.*.rep.snn
.*.rep.xrf
.*.rdb
.probeData

# ---- Genus / Innovus scratch ----
*.logv
*.logv[0-9]*
.rs_*.tstamp
**/work/fv/
qrc_*.log
extLogDir/
*.cmd.gz

# ---- Simulation outputs (Spectre/ADE) ----
psf/
*.raw/
simulation/

# ---- OS / editor ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~

# PVS LVS binary results cache
.lvsResults
